{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CG8aCGc9xgX4ob9rh4d5Gj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full context — the existing imagined_experiments.yaml, the meta.yaml tier definitions, and the updated median tier definition from the user. The key differences in this updated median tier: dual ≈ ESS-only (statistically indistinguishable), τ robust only in [0.6, 0.8], ρ=0.6 PPL much higher than previously estimated, and need to reframe α_eff contribution. Let me generate the complete predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Dual-constraint ≈ ESS-only（统计不可分，Δ < seed variance ~0.01），α_eff 不提供独立的 empirical 性能贡献。\n  Reframe：dual-constraint 是 principled default——收敛理论指导 τ 选择 + α_eff 提供最小干预语义，\n  性能等价但有理论 motivation。两种 adaptive 策略都消除 grid search（6N→1 runs），\n  论文贡献重心从 \"α_eff 带来更好性能\" 转为 \"adaptive b* 框架本身（含 ESS-only 变体）的实用价值\n  + dual-constraint 提供有收敛理论支撑的推导框架，推荐为默认方案\"。\n  τ sweep 证明 [0.6, 0.8] 宽泛可工作区域，但 τ=0.5/0.9 边界退化（+0.03-0.05 PPL），\n  不能声称全域不敏感。ρ=0.6 效应放大有限（Δ ≈ ρ=0.4），PPL 退化超线性（18.2-18.7 vs 17.69），\n  说明 adaptive reweighting 在高污染下缓解能力有限。\n  Claim 1 降低 α_eff 独立贡献声称强度，Claim 2 不变，Claim 3 补充 τ 有效范围说明。\n  补充亮点：lightweight detector sufficiency + batchsize 消融证明 n_min knife-edge 是 bs=4 artifact。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Grid-b low (b<0.5) — 确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed42\n    description: \"扩展 grid search 到 b<0.5，确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外（seed42）\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.662\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.650\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.648\n      best_b_extended: 0.3\n      best_ppl_extended: 17.648\n      improvement_over_b0_5: 0.003\n      train_runtime_s_per_b: 13000\n      gpu_hours_total: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL landscape 在 b=0.1-0.5 极平坦（全范围仅 0.014 PPL）。b=0.3 比 b=0.5 微改善 0.003，\n      因为更温和的 downweighting 避免对中等 q-score 样本（q~0.5-0.7，占 46.3%）过度惩罚。\n      b=0.1 反弹至 17.662 因 downweighting 力度不足——w=(1-q)^0.1 对高 q 样本（q=0.85）\n      权重仍为 (0.15)^0.1≈0.81，过于宽容。b=0.2-0.4 形成宽阔最优平台。\n      关键结论：b=0.5 不在搜索边界外，真实最优在 b=0.2-0.4，但差异在 seed variance 以内。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Extended Grid-b PPL (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [b, eval_ppl_holdout, Δ_vs_uniform, relative_improvement_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, 17.662, -0.028, 0.158]\n          - [0.2, 17.650, -0.040, 0.226]\n          - [0.3, 17.648, -0.042, 0.237]\n          - [0.5, 17.651, -0.039, 0.220]\n          - [1.0, 17.692, 0.002, -0.011]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1-5.0)，宽阔 U-shape 底部在 b=0.2-0.5\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.3 是 seed42 extended grid-best，但与 b=0.5 仅差 0.003（远小于 seed variance ~0.01）。\n      PPL landscape 平坦性是 dual ≈ ESS-only 结果的微观基础——b* 的精确值在此区间内不重要。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed123\n    description: \"Seed123 b<0.5 扩展，验证跨 seed 一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.654\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.639\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.636\n      best_b_extended: 0.3\n      best_ppl_extended: 17.636\n      improvement_over_b0_5: 0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 seed42 一致趋势：b=0.3 略优于 b=0.5。Seed123 是三个 seed 中 PPL 最低的\n      （baseline 和 grid-best 都最好），绝对差异被压缩至 0.002。\n      平坦 landscape 的跨 seed 一致性支持 \"b=0.3-0.5 区间内 b 选择不关键\" 论点。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"与 seed42 趋势一致。b=0.3 marginal 最优但差异在 noise 范围内。\"\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed456\n    description: \"Seed456 b<0.5 扩展\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.666\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.653\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.649\n      best_b_extended: 0.3\n      best_ppl_extended: 17.649\n      improvement_over_b0_5: 0.001\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed456 在 MVP 中 adaptive (17.66) 已是最弱 seed。b=0.3 仅比 b=0.5 好 0.001，\n      几乎不可区分。此 seed PPL 方差较大（seed456 的 grid-b2.0 为 17.989 远高于其他 seed），\n      b<0.5 的微小改善完全被噪声淹没。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"b=0.3 与 b=0.5 差异最小的 seed，进一步确认 landscape 平坦性。\"\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_eval\n    description: \"汇总三 seed × 三 b 值，更新 grid-best 并重算 aggregate ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      new_grid_best_b_consensus: 0.3\n      avg_improvement_over_b0_5: 0.002\n      cross_seed_consistency: \"3/3 seeds show b=0.3 >= b=0.5\"\n      updated_aggregate_ratio_pct: 85.8\n      ppl_range_b0_1_to_b0_5: 0.014\n    result_rationale: >\n      汇总后 b=0.3 在所有三 seed 上均 >= b=0.5，但平均改善仅 0.002。\n      更新 grid-best 为 b=0.3 后 aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 微降至 ~85.8%，\n      因 adaptive b* median ~0.88 离 b=0.3 更远。但差异仍在 seed variance 内。\n      Per-seed 重算：\n        seed42: (17.690-17.650)/(17.690-17.648) = 95.2%\n        seed123: (17.690-17.643)/(17.690-17.636) = 87.0%\n        seed456: (17.700-17.660)/(17.700-17.649) = 78.4%\n        aggregate: (95.2+87.0+78.4)/3 = 86.9%\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Extended Grid-b Summary (3 seeds × full range)\"\n        columns: [b, seed42_ppl, seed123_ppl, seed456_ppl, mean_ppl, rank]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, 17.662, 17.654, 17.666, 17.661, 4]\n          - [0.2, 17.650, 17.639, 17.653, 17.647, 2]\n          - [0.3, 17.648, 17.636, 17.649, 17.644, 1]\n          - [0.5, 17.651, 17.638, 17.650, 17.646, 3]\n          - [1.0, 17.692, 17.674, 17.680, 17.682, 5]\n          - [1.5, 17.718, 17.701, 17.710, 17.710, 6]\n          - [2.0, 17.741, 17.725, 17.989, 17.818, 7]\n          - [3.0, 17.774, 17.760, 17.921, 17.818, 8]\n          - [5.0, 17.818, 17.804, 17.993, 17.872, 9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"完整 9-point grid-b PPL curve (3 seeds + error bars)，标注 flat bottom b=0.2-0.5\"\n    analysis: >\n      Grid-best 从 b=0.5 更新为 b=0.3，差异 <0.003 不改变核心叙事。\n      视觉化 \"adaptive b* median ~0.88 仍在平坦区域右沿\" 支持 dual ≈ ESS-only 的合理性——\n      在此平坦区间内，b* 选择策略（min-intervention vs max-intervention）不产生可检测差异。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: ρ=0.6 Contamination — 效应放大验证\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_datagen\n    description: \"60% 污染比例数据生成与检测器评分\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      synthetic_fraction: 0.6\n      real_fraction: 0.4\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.932\n      q_score_mean: 0.72\n      q_score_median: 0.82\n      q_score_std: 0.34\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高合成比例使 q-score 分布向高端偏移（mean 0.60→0.72），batch 内合成样本更多。\n      TF-IDF+LR AUC 微降（0.939→0.932），因更多合成样本意味着合成风格多样化，\n      少量非典型合成样本（风格接近真实文本）拉低 AUC。q-score 中位数上升至 0.82，\n      反映多数样本被识别为高概率合成。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"基础设施步骤。检测器在 60% 条件下仍可用（AUC 0.932）。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_uniform\n    description: \"60% 污染下 uniform baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.50\n      train_loss: 7.55\n      total_steps: 6103\n      ppl_degradation_vs_40pct: 0.81\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 合成数据导致 PPL 超线性退化（17.69→18.50，+0.81）。退化非线性机制：\n      (1) 超过 50% 临界点后合成分布开始主导梯度方向，模型学习合成 pattern 而非真实语言；\n      (2) 自蒸馏（Qwen3-0.6B 生成→Qwen3-0.6B 训练）在高比例时放大 mode collapse——\n      合成数据的低熵特征（重复句式、有限词汇选择）被强化。\n      这与 Strong Model Collapse (ICLR 2025) 的理论预测一致：\n      微量合成即开始退化，高比例时退化加速。\n      0%→40% 退化约 +0.3，40%→60% 退化约 +0.81，呈超线性增长（~ρ^1.8 关系）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 uniform 退化远超线性预期，说明高污染比例下预训练质量急剧下降。\n      为 adaptive 提供更大改善空间，但也意味着 reweighting 面对更困难的任务。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_adaptive\n    description: \"验证效应量随污染增大而放大（或不放大）\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.45\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.05\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.270\n      amplification_factor_vs_40pct: 1.25\n      b_star_mean: 0.95\n      b_star_median: 0.62\n      b_star_std: 1.35\n      b_star_pct_below_0_5: 32.5\n      ess_binding_pct: 72.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      效应放大仅 ~1.25x（Δ 0.04→0.05），远低于 best tier 预期的 3-5x，\n      落在 median tier \"未明显放大\" 假设范围内。放大有限的核心原因：\n      (1) 60% 高 q 样本使 ESS 下降更快——每个 batch 4 样本中平均 2.4 个是高 q，\n      ESS 约束在 72% reweighted batch 中是 binding constraint（vs ρ=0.4 的 60%），\n      迫使 b* 更保守（median 0.88→0.62），压缩了 downweighting 空间；\n      (2) Δ_adaptive 几乎等于 Δ_at_40%（0.05 vs 0.04），说明方法在两个污染比例下\n      捕获的改善绝对量相当——更差的 baseline 确实提供更大 room，但 ESS 约束\n      同步收紧抵消了大部分额外空间。\n      b* 分布左移是 ESS 约束在高污染下正确工作的信号——防止过度 downweight\n      导致有效 batch size 崩溃。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Effect Amplification: ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6\"\n        columns: [metric, rho_0.4, rho_0.6, amplification]\n        rows:\n          - [uniform_ppl, 17.69, 18.50, \"-\"]\n          - [adaptive_ppl, 17.65, 18.45, \"-\"]\n          - [absolute_Δ, 0.04, 0.05, \"1.25x\"]\n          - [relative_improvement_pct, 0.226, 0.270, \"1.20x\"]\n          - [b_star_median, 0.88, 0.62, \"-\"]\n          - [ess_binding_pct, 59.9, 72.0, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Contamination ratio vs relative PPL improvement 折线图（2 points），标注效应几乎未放大\"\n      - \"b* distribution: ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6 histogram overlay，展示左移及 ESS binding 增加\"\n    analysis: >\n      效应放大有限（1.25x）不足以作为独立 selling point。但方向正确（正值、自适应响应），\n      支持方法在不同污染下仍可工作。更重要的发现是 b* 自适应响应 contamination 变化\n      的能力本身——b* median 从 0.88 降至 0.62 是方法 \"principled\" 的佐证。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\n    description: \"60% 污染下 grid-b=0.5 参考值\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.44\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.06\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.324\n      ratio_adaptive_vs_grid_at_60pct: 83.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Grid-b=0.5 在 ρ=0.6 下效应也增大（Δ 0.039→0.060，~1.5x），且放大略多于 adaptive，\n      因 b=0.5 固定值不受 ESS 约束收紧影响。在高污染时 b=0.5 的固定 downweighting\n      恰好位于更有效区域——高 q 样本更多意味着 b=0.5 的总体 downweight 效果更强。\n      Adaptive vs grid ratio 83.3%（vs ρ=0.4 的 88.6%）略降，因 adaptive b* median (0.62)\n      在 ρ=0.6 时被 ESS 约束拉到比 b=0.5 更低的值。\n      这暗示在高污染场景下，ESS 约束可能过于保守——dual-constraint 的 min-intervention\n      原则在此有潜在代价。但代价很小（PPL 差 0.01），不影响核心叙事。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 下 ratio 略降，但 adaptive 仍在 grid-b=0.5 的 seed variance 范围内。\n      支持 \"不同污染比例下 adaptive 始终 comparable to fixed b\" 的 robustness 叙事。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: n_min Sensitivity — 完整 5-point curve\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_1\n    description: \"ESS 约束最宽松——仅需 1 个有效样本\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.655\n      b_star_mean: 1.85\n      b_star_median: 1.15\n      b_star_std: 2.6\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 6.8\n      b_star_max: 20\n      train_loss: 7.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 与 n_min=2 差异不大（PPL 17.655 vs 17.650，仅差 0.005）。\n      关键原因：在 batch_size=4、ρ=0.4 设定下，ESS 约束在 n_min=2 时对大多数 batch\n      已非 binding（~50% batch 为 clean 即 b*=0，另有 ~20% batch α_eff 是 binding）。\n      n_min 从 2 降到 1 仅松弛了那些 ESS 恰好在 1-2 之间被 clamp 的 batch（约 10-15%），\n      这些 batch 的 b* 从被截断值升至更高值，但 PPL landscape 平坦性确保影响可忽略。\n      b* 分布右移（mean 1.40→1.85, median 0.88→1.15）反映少量 batch b* 释放，\n      但尾部极端值（b*>5 占 6.8%）增加的梯度噪声被其他 batch 平均化稀释。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* histogram: n_min=1 vs n_min=2 overlay，展示右尾膨胀但主体变化不大\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 可用且与 n_min=2 几乎等价。确认在当前设定下 ESS 约束对多数 batch 非 binding，\n      降低 n_min 的边际效应很小。支持 \"n_min 是一个不敏感的 empirical default\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_4\n    description: \"ESS = batch_size，预期退化为 uniform\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_at_zero: 100.0\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      effective_behavior: \"uniform\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min = batch_size = 4 要求 ESS >= 4，即 Kish's ESS = (Σw_i)²/Σw_i² 达到样本总数。\n      数学上这仅当所有权重完全相等时满足（w_i = c for all i），即 b*=0（所有权重为 1）。\n      对任何 b>0，至少一个 w_i = (1-q_i)^b < 1（因为 q_i > 0），使 ESS < 4。\n      因此所有 batch 被迫 b*=0，方法完全退化为 uniform training，PPL = 17.69。\n      价值：建立 sensitivity curve 的理论上界，证明 ESS 约束过紧时方法优雅退化。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"n_min=4 确认理论预期：ESS 约束过紧 → 优雅退化为 uniform，不崩溃不发散。\"\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_5\n    description: \"n_min > batch_size 的退化验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      effective_behavior: \"uniform\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4 是物理不可能满足的约束（4 个样本的 ESS 最大为 4）。\n      与 n_min=4 结果完全一致：b*=0, uniform 行为, PPL=17.69。\n      Sanity check 确认代码在超范围边界条件下正确 fallback 到 b*=0，无异常行为。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"n_min Sensitivity Summary (seed42, ρ=0.4, batch_size=4)\"\n        columns: [n_min, eval_ppl, b_star_median, effective_mode, notes]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 17.655, 1.15, \"adaptive\", \"ESS 约束几乎无约束力，与 n_min=2 差异 <0.005\"]\n          - [2, 17.650, 0.88, \"adaptive\", \"Sweet spot (adaptive_fix default)\"]\n          - [3, 17.690, 0.45, \"partially clamped\", \"seed42 退化（known D012），ESS 过紧\"]\n          - [4, 17.690, 0.0, \"uniform\", \"n_min=batch_size → 仅 b*=0 可行\"]\n          - [5, 17.690, 0.0, \"uniform\", \"不可满足约束 → fallback b*=0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"n_min sensitivity curve (5 points)：n_min=1-2 平台，n_min>=3 cliff（at batch_size=4）\"\n    analysis: >\n      完整 5-point curve：n_min=1 和 n_min=2 都可工作且几乎等价，选择不敏感。\n      n_min>=3 在 batch_size=4 下退化是 batch size 的 artifact 而非方法固有缺陷。\n      论文呈现此 curve + batch_size=8/16 消融共同证明 \"n_min=2 是安全的跨设定默认值\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: ESS-only Baseline — 核心对照实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ESS-only adaptive baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_ess_only_baseline\n    description: \"max{b : ESS≥n_min} vs inf{b : α_eff≥τ} s.t. ESS≥n_min — head-to-head 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.66\n      delta_vs_dual: 0.01\n      delta_significant: false\n      b_star_mean_ess_only: 4.15\n      b_star_median_ess_only: 3.20\n      b_star_std_ess_only: 3.8\n      ess_at_b_star_mean: 2.05\n      train_loss: 9.85\n      alpha_eff_binding_irrelevant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      ESS-only 选择 max{b : ESS≥2}——在 ESS 允许范围内最大 downweight。\n      b* median 3.20（vs dual 0.88）反映 max-intervention 策略：尽可能多地清洁。\n      但 PPL 17.66 与 dual 的 17.65 仅差 0.01，统计不可区分（seed variance ~0.01）。\n      核心原因仍是 PPL landscape 平坦——在 b=0.3-5.0 范围内 PPL 仅变化 0.17，\n      而 ESS-only 的 b* median 3.20 对应 grid-b=3.0 的 PPL 17.774，但 per-batch adaptive\n      选择的 b* 并非固定在 3.20——低污染 batch 仍选 b*=0，高污染 batch 才选大 b*，\n      这种 adaptive 行为部分缓解了 max-intervention 的损失。\n      两个方法的 eval_ppl 差异 <0.01 确认 α_eff 约束不提供独立的 empirical 性能贡献。\n      但 dual-constraint 的 b* 分布更集中（std 1.93 vs 3.8），梯度方差更小，\n      理论上在更大模型/更长训练中可能有优势——这是可声称的 principled advantage。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Dual-Constraint vs ESS-only Head-to-Head (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [metric, dual_constraint, ess_only, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [eval_ppl_holdout, 17.650, 17.660, 0.010]\n          - [b_star_mean, 1.40, 4.15, 2.75]\n          - [b_star_median, 0.88, 3.20, 2.32]\n          - [b_star_std, 1.93, 3.80, 1.87]\n          - [train_loss, 7.52, 9.85, 2.33]\n          - [ess_at_reweighted_mean, 2.60, 2.05, -0.55]\n          - [gradient_variance_relative, 1.0, 1.35, 0.35]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双轴图：b* distribution overlay (dual vs ESS-only)，突出 2.5x 差异\"\n      - \"PPL 对比 bar chart with seed variance error bars，可视化 'indistinguishable'\"\n    analysis: >\n      Dual ≈ ESS-only 在 eval_ppl 上不可区分。论文叙事转向：\n      \"两种 adaptive 策略都消除 grid search，性能等价。Dual-constraint 推荐为默认方案\n      因其有收敛理论支撑的 principled 推导框架，且 b* 分布更集中（lower gradient variance）\n      提供理论上的稳定性优势——尽管在当前实验规模下未观测到 PPL 差异。\"\n      α_eff 的贡献从 \"性能贡献\" reframe 为 \"principled derivation + interpretability\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: τ Sweep — Claim 3 证据\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"τ sweep (τ=0.5/0.6/0.7/0.9/0.95, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_tau_sweep\n    description: \"τ 全范围扫描，验证方法对 τ 的敏感度及有效工作范围\"\n    expected_results:\n      tau_05_eval_ppl: 17.70\n      tau_06_eval_ppl: 17.66\n      tau_07_eval_ppl: 17.65\n      tau_08_eval_ppl: 17.65\n      tau_09_eval_ppl: 17.68\n      tau_095_eval_ppl: 17.72\n      ppl_range: 0.07\n      ppl_std: 0.027\n      robust_range: \"[0.6, 0.8]\"\n      best_tau: 0.7\n      best_ppl: 17.65\n      tau_05_b_star_median: 0.25\n      tau_06_b_star_median: 0.55\n      tau_07_b_star_median: 0.72\n      tau_08_b_star_median: 0.88\n      tau_09_b_star_median: 1.85\n      tau_095_b_star_median: 3.50\n      tau_05_reweighted_pct: 22.0\n      tau_06_reweighted_pct: 38.0\n      tau_07_reweighted_pct: 45.0\n      tau_08_reweighted_pct: 50.1\n      tau_09_reweighted_pct: 58.0\n      tau_095_reweighted_pct: 65.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      τ 在 [0.6, 0.8] 内鲁棒（PPL 差异 ≤0.01），但边界退化明显：\n      τ=0.5 退化机制——阈值过低，α_eff(0)=1-mean(q)≈0.4 < 0.5 仅在高污染 batch 触发\n      小幅 reweighting（仅 22% batch 被 reweight，b* median 仅 0.25），接近 uniform 行为，\n      PPL 17.70 vs uniform 17.69 几乎无改善（Δ=-0.01 即 noise）。\n      τ=0.9/0.95 退化机制——阈值过高，α_eff(b) 需要很大 b 才能达到 0.9/0.95，\n      大多数 batch 的 b* 被推到高值（median 1.85/3.50），ESS 约束频繁触发导致 b* 被 clamp，\n      部分 batch 在 α_eff 无法达到 τ 的情况下被 clamp 到 ESS 边界——\n      实质退化为 ESS-only 行为但多了一层无效计算。过度 downweighting 增大梯度方差。\n      [0.6, 0.8] 鲁棒的直觉：这个范围对应 \"每个 batch 至少 60-80% 有效真实贡献\"，\n      与 ρ=0.4 的真实比例 0.6 匹配良好——阈值在真实比例附近宽幅可工作。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"τ Sensitivity Sweep (seed42, ρ=0.4, n_min=2)\"\n        columns: [τ, eval_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform, b_star_median, reweighted_pct, regime]\n        rows:\n          - [0.5, 17.70, -0.01, 0.25, \"22%\", \"under-reweight (≈uniform)\"]\n          - [0.6, 17.66, -0.03, 0.55, \"38%\", \"working (robust range)\"]\n          - [0.7, 17.65, -0.04, 0.72, \"45%\", \"working (near optimal)\"]\n          - [0.8, 17.65, -0.04, 0.88, \"50%\", \"working (current default)\"]\n          - [0.9, 17.68, -0.01, 1.85, \"58%\", \"over-reweight (boundary)\"]\n          - [0.95, 17.72, 0.03, 3.50, \"65%\", \"over-reweight (degraded)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"τ vs eval_ppl U-curve，标注 robust range [0.6, 0.8] 和边界退化区域\"\n      - \"τ vs b_star_median 单调递增曲线，展示 τ 如何控制 downweighting 强度\"\n    analysis: >\n      τ 在 [0.6, 0.8] 宽幅鲁棒（4 个 τ 值 PPL 差异 ≤ 0.01），支持 Claim 3 的修正版本：\n      \"τ 是一个不敏感的 empirical default with theoretical motivation，\n      在宽泛范围内均可工作，但不能声称全域不敏感——边界 τ 导致 0.03-0.07 PPL 退化。\"\n      与 n_min sensitivity 联合构成双超参 robustness 证据。\n      建议论文推荐 τ=0.7 或 τ=0.8 为默认值，差异在 noise 内。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Golden Ratio Oracle Baseline\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Golden Ratio oracle baseline (w=1/φ, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_golden_ratio_baseline\n    description: \"已知比例 oracle baseline：synthetic weight = 1/φ ≈ 0.618\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.64\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.05\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.282\n      ratio_adaptive_vs_golden: 80.0\n      weight_synthetic: 0.618\n      weight_real: 1.0\n      effective_ess_per_batch: 3.45\n      train_loss: 8.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      Golden Ratio (w*=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic, 1.0 for real) 使用已知比例 k=0.4 的 oracle 信息，\n      理论上是最优固定权重（arXiv 2502.18049）。PPL 17.64 与 adaptive 17.65 持平或略优（差 0.01），\n      因为 oracle 避免了 per-batch b* 估计的噪声——每个 batch 的权重固定且最优。\n      略优但非显著优（0.01 < seed variance 0.01），说明 adaptive 在不知道比例的情况下\n      已达到接近 oracle 性能——这是 Claim 3 的强支撑证据。\n      与 ESS-only ≈ dual 的发现联合：三种 adaptive 策略（dual, ESS-only, golden ratio oracle）\n      在当前 PPL landscape 下都收敛到相似性能，因为 b=0.2-1.0 区间 PPL 极度平坦。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Method Comparison Including Oracle (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [method, requires_known_ratio, eval_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform]\n        rows:\n          - [\"uniform\", \"no\", 17.690, 0.000]\n          - [\"adaptive (dual)\", \"no\", 17.650, -0.040]\n          - [\"ESS-only\", \"no\", 17.660, -0.030]\n          - [\"golden ratio oracle\", \"yes (k=0.4)\", 17.640, -0.050]\n          - [\"grid-best (b=0.3)\", \"no (but needs grid search)\", 17.648, -0.042]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 5 methods PPL comparison with seed variance error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Golden ratio oracle 略优但与 adaptive 不可区分（Δ=0.01 < seed var）。\n      论文叙事：adaptive 在不知道 contamination ratio 的条件下达到接近 oracle 性能，\n      验证方法设计的合理性。不需要已知比例也能接近理论最优。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Batch Size Ablation — 证明 n_min knife-edge 是 bs=4 artifact\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"batch_size=8 + grad_accum=2 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: p0_batchsize_8\n    description: \"更大 micro-batch 下 adaptive b* 行为及 n_min=2 有效性\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.64\n      b_star_mean: 1.35\n      b_star_median: 0.85\n      b_star_std: 1.65\n      n_min_ratio: 0.25\n      ess_binding_pct: 48.0\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 23.0\n      clean_batch_pct: 29.0\n      nmin3_would_work: true\n      nmin3_simulated_ppl: 17.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=8 使 per-batch q-score 统计更稳定（8 样本 vs 4 样本的分布估计方差降 ~50%），\n      b* 分布略收窄（std 1.93→1.65）。n_min/batch_size = 2/8 = 0.25 远低于 0.5（at bs=4），\n      ESS 约束大幅松弛——ESS binding 比例从 ~60% 降至 ~48%。\n      PPL 微改善 17.65→17.64（差 0.01），来自更准确的 per-batch b* 估计。\n      关键发现：在 bs=8 下 n_min=3 也能工作（模拟 PPL ~17.65），\n      证明 n_min=3 在 bs=4 的退化（D012）是小 batch 的 artifact——\n      n_min/batch_size 比值才是关键参数，而非 n_min 绝对值。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Batch Size Effect on Adaptive b* (n_min=2, seed42)\"\n        columns: [batch_size, grad_accum, eval_ppl, b_star_median, ess_binding_pct, n_min_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [4, 4, 17.650, 0.88, 59.9, 0.50]\n          - [8, 2, 17.640, 0.85, 48.0, 0.25]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* distribution at batch_size=4 vs 8 vs 16 overlay histogram\"\n    analysis: >\n      bs=8 确认 n_min knife-edge 随 batch size 消解。n_min=2 在 bs>=8 时约束极松。\n      支持论文 Reviewer concern 应对：\"n_min=3 退化是 bs=4 artifact，\n      更大 batch (实际使用场景) 下 n_min 选择完全不敏感。\"\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=16 + grad_accum=1 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: p0_batchsize_16\n    description: \"最大 micro-batch 下 adaptive b* 行为\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.64\n      b_star_mean: 1.32\n      b_star_median: 0.83\n      b_star_std: 1.50\n      n_min_ratio: 0.125\n      ess_binding_pct: 38.0\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 28.0\n      clean_batch_pct: 14.0\n      b_star_trajectory_smooth: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=16 进一步改善 per-batch 统计估计质量。b* 分布最集中（std 1.50），\n      因 16 样本的 q-score 均值/方差估计更准确。ESS binding 继续下降至 38%，\n      因 n_min/batch = 2/16 = 0.125 极低——ESS 约束实际不起作用。\n      α_eff binding 比例增加至 28%（vs bs=4 的 20.2%），因 batch 更大时\n      几乎每个 batch 都有足够的合成样本混入，需要 reweighting。\n      PPL 与 bs=8 持平（17.64），说明 bs=8 已足够获得 b* 估计的大部分收益。\n      b* 轨迹更平滑（batch-to-batch 变化更小），训练更稳定但 PPL 未进一步改善——\n      确认 PPL landscape 平坦性在不同 batch granularity 下的一致性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Batch Size Sweep Summary (adaptive, n_min=2, seed42)\"\n        columns: [batch_size, eval_ppl, b_star_std, ess_binding_pct, α_eff_binding_pct, clean_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [4, 17.650, 1.93, 59.9, 20.2, 49.9]\n          - [8, 17.640, 1.65, 48.0, 23.0, 29.0]\n          - [16, 17.640, 1.50, 38.0, 28.0, 14.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel: batch_size vs (eval_ppl, b_star_std, ess_binding_pct)\"\n      - \"b* 轨迹 time series 三行对比，展示 bs 越大越平滑\"\n    analysis: >\n      bs=8 和 bs=16 性能持平，说明 bs=8 已足够。n_min knife-edge 在 bs>=8 完全消失。\n      论文可 claim：\"n_min=2 是安全的跨 batch-size 默认值，\n      且在实际使用场景（bs>=8）下 n_min 选择完全不敏感。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Detector Quality Ablation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_modernbert\n    description: \"高质量 ModernBERT 检测器用于 detector quality ablation\"\n    expected_results:\n      auc: 0.986\n      accuracy: 0.962\n      ece_calibrated: 0.025\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.42\n      q_score_bimodality: \"强——接近 0/1 两极化\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 基于 transformer 语义特征（上下文连贯性、语义深度），\n      比 TF-IDF+LR 表面特征（n-gram 频率、词汇分布）更准确，AUC 0.939→0.986 (+0.047)\n      与 Drayson et al. 报告一致。q-score 分布更双峰化（std 0.374→0.42）——\n      transformer 特征使真实/合成样本被更明确区分，q 值集中在 [0,0.1] 和 [0.9,1.0]。\n      更好的校准（ECE 0.048→0.025）来自 transformer 的更强表征能力——\n      输出概率更准确反映真实后验。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"两个检测器 ROC 曲线叠加 + q-score 分布直方图对比\"\n    analysis: \"为 detector quality ablation 提供高质量对照组。Setup 步骤。\"\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_ablation_training\n    description: \"检测器质量 ablation：AUC 提升 5% 换来多少 PPL 改善\"\n    expected_results:\n      adaptive_modernbert_ppl: 17.645\n      uniform_modernbert_ppl: 17.69\n      improvement_vs_tfidf_adaptive: 0.005\n      b_star_mean_modernbert: 1.25\n      b_star_median_modernbert: 0.78\n      ratio_vs_grid_modernbert: 90.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高 AUC 提供更准确 q-score，但 PPL landscape 极平坦，更好的 q-score 仅带来\n      微小改善（17.645 vs TF-IDF 的 17.650，差 0.005，远小于 seed variance）。\n      b* median 更低（0.78 vs 0.88），因为 ModernBERT q-score 更双峰化，\n      高 q 样本 q 值更接近 1.0，相同 b 下权重更小（w=(1-0.95)^b << (1-0.85)^b），\n      ESS 更快触及下界，b* 被限制在更小值。\n      关键 co-finding：AUC 从 0.939→0.986（+5%）仅换来 0.005 PPL（0.03% relative），\n      边际收益极低。因为 reweighting 依赖 q-score 的 ranking 而非绝对精度——\n      只要 q-score 的 rank order 大致正确（AUC>0.9），adaptive b* 就能工作。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Detector Quality Ablation\"\n        columns: [detector, AUC, adaptive_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform, ratio_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TF-IDF+LR\", 0.939, 17.650, -0.040, 88.6]\n          - [\"ModernBERT\", 0.986, 17.645, -0.045, 90.5]\n          - [\"Δ_detector\", \"+0.047\", \"-0.005\", \"-0.005\", \"+1.9\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detector AUC vs adaptive PPL scatter (2 points)，标注边际收益递减\"\n    analysis: >\n      Detector quality ablation 产生关键 co-finding：AUC 0.939 即足够，\n      无需昂贵 ModernBERT。lightweight detector sufficiency 可升级为 co-contribution。\n      \"calibration (low ECE) > classification accuracy (high AUC)\"——\n      TF-IDF 校准后 ECE=0.048 已足够支撑有效的 b* 推导。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Cross-Generator Robustness\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_datagen\n    description: \"跨生成器合成数据准备\"\n    expected_results:\n      synthetic_source: \"Llama-3.2-1B\"\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      contamination_ratio: 0.4\n      detector_auc_cross_gen: 0.925\n      q_score_mean: 0.55\n      q_score_std: 0.39\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨模型生成的合成数据风格不同（Llama 倾向更长句子、不同词汇偏好），\n      TF-IDF+LR 检测器 AUC 下降 0.939→0.925（-0.014），因检测器训练在 Qwen 生成数据上，\n      对 Llama 风格泛化略弱。但 AUC 仍 >0.9，说明 n-gram 特征对合成文本的\n      通用统计特征（低困惑度、高重复率、有限 vocabulary 子集）有一定泛化能力。\n      q-score 均值下降（0.60→0.55）反映检测器对 OOD 合成样本信心降低。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"跨生成器数据准备。检测器在 OOD 生成器上 AUC 下降 ~1.5%，仍可用。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_training\n    description: \"跨生成器场景下 adaptive 表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.72\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.69\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.03\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.169\n      ratio_vs_in_distribution: 75.0\n      b_star_mean: 1.55\n      b_star_median: 0.95\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨生成器是 adaptive 表现较弱的设置。Llama 生成的合成数据与 Qwen 分布差异更大，\n      uniform 略差（17.72 vs 17.69，跨生成器合成数据更难学习）。\n      但 adaptive 改善仅 0.03（vs in-distribution 0.04），ratio 降至 ~75%。\n      两个原因：(1) 检测器 AUC 下降使 q-score 精度降低——高概率真实样本被误判为\n      中等 q，导致不必要的 downweighting；(2) 跨生成器合成数据 q-score 分布更分散\n      （std 0.39 vs 0.37），per-batch 统计量噪声更大，b* 估计质量下降。\n      仍为正方向改善，说明方法在 OOD 检测条件下仍有价值但效果打折。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"In-distribution vs Cross-generator\"\n        columns: [setting, generator, detector_AUC, uniform_ppl, adaptive_ppl, ratio_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"in-distribution\", \"Qwen3-0.6B\", 0.939, 17.69, 17.65, 88.6]\n          - [\"cross-generator\", \"Llama-3.2-1B\", 0.925, 17.72, 17.69, 75.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-batch b* distribution: in-distribution vs cross-generator overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-generator 拉低 aggregate ratio 至 ~75%，是跨设定 win rate 下降的主因之一。\n      论文中需 per-batch b* 诊断解释，并指出这是 detector OOD 泛化问题而非方法缺陷。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Llama-3.2-3B — 跨模型验证\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: p1_llama3b_setup\n    description: \"3B 模型环境准备、数据适配\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_size_gb: 6.2\n      gpu_memory_usage_gb: 72\n      detector_auc_reused: 0.939\n      gradient_checkpointing: true\n      batch_size: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      使用与 Qwen3-0.6B 相同的合成数据（Qwen 生成），Llama 训练（cross-architecture 设置）。\n      TF-IDF+LR 检测器基于文本 n-gram 特征，不依赖训练/推理模型架构，AUC 不变。\n      4× RTX 6000 96GB 可 fit 3B（weights ~6.2GB FP16 + optimizer states ×2 + activations），\n      需 gradient checkpointing（峰值显存 ~72GB），micro-batch size 降至 2。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Setup 步骤。3B 可在当前 GPU 配置训练，需 gradient checkpointing + 小 batch。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p1_llama3b_uniform\n    description: \"3B 模型 uniform baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 13.52\n      train_loss: 5.88\n      total_steps: 3800\n      train_runtime_s: 43200\n      gpu_hours: 48.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-3B 容量是 Qwen3-0.6B 的 5x，在相同数据上 PPL 显著更低（13.52 vs 17.69）。\n      更大模型更好地建模语言分布——即使 40% 数据为合成污染，3B 的表征能力足够\n      学到真实语言的核心结构。训练时间大幅增加（~12h vs ~3.3h per seed），\n      步数因 micro-batch size = 2（vs 4）和 grad_accum 调整而不同。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"3B uniform baseline 建立跨模型对比参考点。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p1_llama3b_adaptive\n    description: \"3B 模型上 adaptive b* 的跨模型泛化\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 13.46\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.06\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.444\n      amplification_vs_0_6B: 1.96\n      b_star_mean: 1.38\n      b_star_median: 0.85\n      b_star_std: 1.90\n      ratio_vs_estimated_grid: 85.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型效应放大约 2x（relative improvement 0.226%→0.444%），落在 median tier 1.5-3x 范围。\n      放大来自模型容量增加——3B 有足够参数捕捉更细微的真实/合成分布差异，\n      从 reweighting 获益更多。但仍为温和放大，0.44% relative 不构成独立 selling point。\n      b* 分布与 0.6B 高度相似（median 0.85 vs 0.88），因为 b* 由 batch q-score 统计量决定，\n      与模型大小无关——这是方法 \"principled\" 的直接证据。\n      关键发现：adaptive b* 在不同模型上无需任何调整即可工作，\n      vs Drayson 的 per-model b 选择（0.6B 用 b=10, 1.7B 用 b=1）优势明显。\n      但 n_min=2 at batch_size=2 → n_min/batch = 1.0 → ESS 约束极紧。\n      可能需要将 n_min 降至 1 或调整 batch 设置以避免 ESS over-constraining。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Model Comparison (ρ=0.4, adaptive)\"\n        columns: [model, params, uniform_ppl, adaptive_ppl, rel_improvement_pct, b_star_median]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.6B\", 17.69, 17.65, 0.226, 0.88]\n          - [\"Llama-3.2-3B\", \"3.0B\", 13.52, 13.46, 0.444, 0.85]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Model size vs relative PPL improvement 图（2 个模型点）\"\n      - \"b* distribution overlay: Qwen3-0.6B vs Llama-3.2-3B（高度重合）\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨模型泛化成功，b* 分布跨模型稳定是 principled method 的佐证。\n      论文强调 \"zero-tuning-cost across model scales\" + b* 分布的模型无关性。\n      但 batch_size=2 的 n_min 问题需在论文中说明——推荐在小 batch 下使用 n_min=1。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Additional Baselines\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_detect_remove\n    description: \"硬过滤 baseline 对比——soft reweighting vs hard filtering\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.685\n      effective_training_tokens: 130000000\n      data_retention_rate: 0.65\n      false_positive_rate: 0.08\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.005\n    result_rationale: >\n      硬过滤（q>0.5 移除）有两个系统性问题：\n      (1) 移除 ~35% 数据中含 ~8% 误分类真实数据（AUC=0.939 对应 FPR ~8%），\n      训练数据净减少导致 underfitting 压力——130M 有效 tokens vs 200M 的信息量损失大；\n      (2) 二元决策丢弃 q-score 连续信息——q=0.51 和 q=0.99 被同等移除，\n      但 q=0.51 的样本可能有一半概率是真实数据。\n      PPL 17.685 仅比 uniform 好 0.005（12.5% of adaptive 改善），远逊于 adaptive (17.65)。\n      强力支持 soft reweighting > hard filtering 的实现路径选择。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Method Comparison (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n        columns: [method, eval_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform, effective_tokens]\n        rows:\n          - [\"uniform\", 17.690, 0.000, \"200M\"]\n          - [\"detect-and-remove\", 17.685, -0.005, \"130M\"]\n          - [\"grid-best (b=0.3)\", 17.648, -0.042, \"200M\"]\n          - [\"adaptive (dual)\", 17.650, -0.040, \"200M\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: four methods PPL comparison with error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Detect-and-remove 几乎无效（0.005 PPL），强力支持 loss reweighting 路径。\n      与 Drayson SIR（离散重采样）的隐含对比：continuous control > discrete selection。\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_random_reweight\n    description: \"验证 detector signal 是改善的必要来源\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      delta_vs_uniform: 0.005\n      effective_behavior: \"random noise, slight degradation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重不含 contamination 信号，等价于给 SGD 添加 per-sample 乘性噪声。\n      比 uniform 略差（17.695 vs 17.690，+0.005），因随机权重增加梯度估计方差——\n      部分真实样本被无端 downweight 而部分合成样本被 upweight。\n      关键对照：adaptive 改善 0.04 PPL 确实来自 detector q-score 的 contamination 信号，\n      而非 reweighting 本身的正则化效应（如 dropout-like 效果）。\n      \"Detector signal is load-bearing\" 是可量化的结论。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      随机 reweighting 无效甚至略有害，确认 detector signal 是改善来源。\n      论文中作为 \"signal necessity\" ablation，一行结果即可。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extended Validation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p2_domain_skewed\n    description: \"非均匀域分布污染场景——合成数据集中在 code 域\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.71\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.69\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.02\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.113\n      ratio_vs_uniform_injection: 50.0\n      b_star_cross_batch_variance: \"高\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-skewed injection 使合成数据集中在特定域（code-heavy），batch 间 q-score\n      分布差异极大：code-heavy batch q-score 均高（mean ~0.9），其他 batch 接近纯 real。\n      Per-batch α_eff(b) 估计不稳定——code batch 的 4 个样本中 3-4 个高 q，\n      q-score 几乎无变异性（std ~0.05），违反 b* 推导的隐含假设（需要 batch 内 q 有足够 spread）。\n      Code-heavy batch 在 \"全高 q → 任何 b>0 使 ESS 剧降 → b* 被 clamp 到 0 或极小值\"\n      和 \"有足够变异 → 正常 b*\" 之间振荡，adaptive 在此场景表现最弱（ratio ~50%）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-batch b* 轨迹图，标注 code-heavy batch 的 b* 异常模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-skewed 暴露方法弱点：per-batch 估计假设 batch 内 q-score 有足够变异性。\n      论文需在 Limitations 中讨论此现象，并指出缓解方案（更大 batch size, 跨 batch smoothing）。\n      此场景超出 \"uniform random injection\" 的基本假设，不影响核心 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: p2_downstream_eval\n    description: \"下游任务评估——验证 PPL 改善是否转移至 benchmark\"\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_uniform: 34.2\n      mmlu_adaptive: 34.35\n      mmlu_delta: 0.15\n      mmlu_significance: \"not significant (p>0.1)\"\n      hellaswag_uniform: 52.8\n      hellaswag_adaptive: 53.1\n      hellaswag_delta: 0.3\n      hellaswag_significance: \"marginal (p~0.08)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Downstream 改善不一致是 median tier 核心预期。\n      MMLU +0.15% 完全在随机波动范围内——3B 在仅 200M tokens 后 MMLU 远未收敛，\n      baseline ~34% 表明模型仍处于初始化附近（random baseline 25%），信噪比极低。\n      HellaSwag +0.3% 更可能被检测到（对 PPL/language modeling 更直接敏感），\n      但单 seed 单 checkpoint 下 p~0.08 仍不达 0.05 显著性水平。\n      根本限制：200M tokens 预训练对 downstream tasks 信号极弱——\n      通常需 1B+ tokens 才开始看到 meaningful benchmark 变化，\n      0.44% relative PPL 改善不足以穿透 downstream 的高方差。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Downstream Task Results (Llama-3.2-3B, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [task, uniform, adaptive, Δ, significant]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU (5-shot)\", 34.2, 34.35, \"+0.15\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag (0-shot)\", 52.8, 53.1, \"+0.3\", \"Marginal\"]\n          - [\"eval_ppl\", 13.52, 13.46, \"-0.06\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Downstream performance bar chart with error bars + significance markers\"\n    analysis: >\n      下游改善不一致且不显著。论文策略：PPL 为主要评估指标，downstream 作 supplementary。\n      Limitations 中明确说明 200M tokens 规模不足以展现 downstream 统计显著差异，\n      更大规模训练（>1B tokens）是 future work。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22814,"cache_read_input_tokens":37931,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22814},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2699f91-58b1-43cd-84dd-ccef8205b378","uuid":"e585043b-a2f3-4879-8bc8-861bc844b3ee"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":656092,"duration_api_ms":656710,"num_turns":4,"result":"Now I have the full context — the existing imagined_experiments.yaml, the meta.yaml tier definitions, and the updated median tier definition from the user. The key differences in this updated median tier: dual ≈ ESS-only (statistically indistinguishable), τ robust only in [0.6, 0.8], ρ=0.6 PPL much higher than previously estimated, and need to reframe α_eff contribution. Let me generate the complete predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Dual-constraint ≈ ESS-only（统计不可分，Δ < seed variance ~0.01），α_eff 不提供独立的 empirical 性能贡献。\n  Reframe：dual-constraint 是 principled default——收敛理论指导 τ 选择 + α_eff 提供最小干预语义，\n  性能等价但有理论 motivation。两种 adaptive 策略都消除 grid search（6N→1 runs），\n  论文贡献重心从 \"α_eff 带来更好性能\" 转为 \"adaptive b* 框架本身（含 ESS-only 变体）的实用价值\n  + dual-constraint 提供有收敛理论支撑的推导框架，推荐为默认方案\"。\n  τ sweep 证明 [0.6, 0.8] 宽泛可工作区域，但 τ=0.5/0.9 边界退化（+0.03-0.05 PPL），\n  不能声称全域不敏感。ρ=0.6 效应放大有限（Δ ≈ ρ=0.4），PPL 退化超线性（18.2-18.7 vs 17.69），\n  说明 adaptive reweighting 在高污染下缓解能力有限。\n  Claim 1 降低 α_eff 独立贡献声称强度，Claim 2 不变，Claim 3 补充 τ 有效范围说明。\n  补充亮点：lightweight detector sufficiency + batchsize 消融证明 n_min knife-edge 是 bs=4 artifact。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Grid-b low (b<0.5) — 确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed42\n    description: \"扩展 grid search 到 b<0.5，确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外（seed42）\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.662\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.650\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.648\n      best_b_extended: 0.3\n      best_ppl_extended: 17.648\n      improvement_over_b0_5: 0.003\n      train_runtime_s_per_b: 13000\n      gpu_hours_total: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL landscape 在 b=0.1-0.5 极平坦（全范围仅 0.014 PPL）。b=0.3 比 b=0.5 微改善 0.003，\n      因为更温和的 downweighting 避免对中等 q-score 样本（q~0.5-0.7，占 46.3%）过度惩罚。\n      b=0.1 反弹至 17.662 因 downweighting 力度不足——w=(1-q)^0.1 对高 q 样本（q=0.85）\n      权重仍为 (0.15)^0.1≈0.81，过于宽容。b=0.2-0.4 形成宽阔最优平台。\n      关键结论：b=0.5 不在搜索边界外，真实最优在 b=0.2-0.4，但差异在 seed variance 以内。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Extended Grid-b PPL (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [b, eval_ppl_holdout, Δ_vs_uniform, relative_improvement_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, 17.662, -0.028, 0.158]\n          - [0.2, 17.650, -0.040, 0.226]\n          - [0.3, 17.648, -0.042, 0.237]\n          - [0.5, 17.651, -0.039, 0.220]\n          - [1.0, 17.692, 0.002, -0.011]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1-5.0)，宽阔 U-shape 底部在 b=0.2-0.5\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.3 是 seed42 extended grid-best，但与 b=0.5 仅差 0.003（远小于 seed variance ~0.01）。\n      PPL landscape 平坦性是 dual ≈ ESS-only 结果的微观基础——b* 的精确值在此区间内不重要。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed123\n    description: \"Seed123 b<0.5 扩展，验证跨 seed 一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.654\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.639\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.636\n      best_b_extended: 0.3\n      best_ppl_extended: 17.636\n      improvement_over_b0_5: 0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 seed42 一致趋势：b=0.3 略优于 b=0.5。Seed123 是三个 seed 中 PPL 最低的\n      （baseline 和 grid-best 都最好），绝对差异被压缩至 0.002。\n      平坦 landscape 的跨 seed 一致性支持 \"b=0.3-0.5 区间内 b 选择不关键\" 论点。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"与 seed42 趋势一致。b=0.3 marginal 最优但差异在 noise 范围内。\"\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed456\n    description: \"Seed456 b<0.5 扩展\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.666\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.653\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.649\n      best_b_extended: 0.3\n      best_ppl_extended: 17.649\n      improvement_over_b0_5: 0.001\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed456 在 MVP 中 adaptive (17.66) 已是最弱 seed。b=0.3 仅比 b=0.5 好 0.001，\n      几乎不可区分。此 seed PPL 方差较大（seed456 的 grid-b2.0 为 17.989 远高于其他 seed），\n      b<0.5 的微小改善完全被噪声淹没。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"b=0.3 与 b=0.5 差异最小的 seed，进一步确认 landscape 平坦性。\"\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_eval\n    description: \"汇总三 seed × 三 b 值，更新 grid-best 并重算 aggregate ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      new_grid_best_b_consensus: 0.3\n      avg_improvement_over_b0_5: 0.002\n      cross_seed_consistency: \"3/3 seeds show b=0.3 >= b=0.5\"\n      updated_aggregate_ratio_pct: 85.8\n      ppl_range_b0_1_to_b0_5: 0.014\n    result_rationale: >\n      汇总后 b=0.3 在所有三 seed 上均 >= b=0.5，但平均改善仅 0.002。\n      更新 grid-best 为 b=0.3 后 aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 微降至 ~85.8%，\n      因 adaptive b* median ~0.88 离 b=0.3 更远。但差异仍在 seed variance 内。\n      Per-seed 重算：\n        seed42: (17.690-17.650)/(17.690-17.648) = 95.2%\n        seed123: (17.690-17.643)/(17.690-17.636) = 87.0%\n        seed456: (17.700-17.660)/(17.700-17.649) = 78.4%\n        aggregate: (95.2+87.0+78.4)/3 = 86.9%\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Extended Grid-b Summary (3 seeds × full range)\"\n        columns: [b, seed42_ppl, seed123_ppl, seed456_ppl, mean_ppl, rank]\n        rows:\n          - [0.1, 17.662, 17.654, 17.666, 17.661, 4]\n          - [0.2, 17.650, 17.639, 17.653, 17.647, 2]\n          - [0.3, 17.648, 17.636, 17.649, 17.644, 1]\n          - [0.5, 17.651, 17.638, 17.650, 17.646, 3]\n          - [1.0, 17.692, 17.674, 17.680, 17.682, 5]\n          - [1.5, 17.718, 17.701, 17.710, 17.710, 6]\n          - [2.0, 17.741, 17.725, 17.989, 17.818, 7]\n          - [3.0, 17.774, 17.760, 17.921, 17.818, 8]\n          - [5.0, 17.818, 17.804, 17.993, 17.872, 9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"完整 9-point grid-b PPL curve (3 seeds + error bars)，标注 flat bottom b=0.2-0.5\"\n    analysis: >\n      Grid-best 从 b=0.5 更新为 b=0.3，差异 <0.003 不改变核心叙事。\n      视觉化 \"adaptive b* median ~0.88 仍在平坦区域右沿\" 支持 dual ≈ ESS-only 的合理性——\n      在此平坦区间内，b* 选择策略（min-intervention vs max-intervention）不产生可检测差异。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: ρ=0.6 Contamination — 效应放大验证\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_datagen\n    description: \"60% 污染比例数据生成与检测器评分\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      synthetic_fraction: 0.6\n      real_fraction: 0.4\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.932\n      q_score_mean: 0.72\n      q_score_median: 0.82\n      q_score_std: 0.34\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高合成比例使 q-score 分布向高端偏移（mean 0.60→0.72），batch 内合成样本更多。\n      TF-IDF+LR AUC 微降（0.939→0.932），因更多合成样本意味着合成风格多样化，\n      少量非典型合成样本（风格接近真实文本）拉低 AUC。q-score 中位数上升至 0.82，\n      反映多数样本被识别为高概率合成。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"基础设施步骤。检测器在 60% 条件下仍可用（AUC 0.932）。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_uniform\n    description: \"60% 污染下 uniform baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.50\n      train_loss: 7.55\n      total_steps: 6103\n      ppl_degradation_vs_40pct: 0.81\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 合成数据导致 PPL 超线性退化（17.69→18.50，+0.81）。退化非线性机制：\n      (1) 超过 50% 临界点后合成分布开始主导梯度方向，模型学习合成 pattern 而非真实语言；\n      (2) 自蒸馏（Qwen3-0.6B 生成→Qwen3-0.6B 训练）在高比例时放大 mode collapse——\n      合成数据的低熵特征（重复句式、有限词汇选择）被强化。\n      这与 Strong Model Collapse (ICLR 2025) 的理论预测一致：\n      微量合成即开始退化，高比例时退化加速。\n      0%→40% 退化约 +0.3，40%→60% 退化约 +0.81，呈超线性增长（~ρ^1.8 关系）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 uniform 退化远超线性预期，说明高污染比例下预训练质量急剧下降。\n      为 adaptive 提供更大改善空间，但也意味着 reweighting 面对更困难的任务。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_adaptive\n    description: \"验证效应量随污染增大而放大（或不放大）\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.45\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.05\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.270\n      amplification_factor_vs_40pct: 1.25\n      b_star_mean: 0.95\n      b_star_median: 0.62\n      b_star_std: 1.35\n      b_star_pct_below_0_5: 32.5\n      ess_binding_pct: 72.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      效应放大仅 ~1.25x（Δ 0.04→0.05），远低于 best tier 预期的 3-5x，\n      落在 median tier \"未明显放大\" 假设范围内。放大有限的核心原因：\n      (1) 60% 高 q 样本使 ESS 下降更快——每个 batch 4 样本中平均 2.4 个是高 q，\n      ESS 约束在 72% reweighted batch 中是 binding constraint（vs ρ=0.4 的 60%），\n      迫使 b* 更保守（median 0.88→0.62），压缩了 downweighting 空间；\n      (2) Δ_adaptive 几乎等于 Δ_at_40%（0.05 vs 0.04），说明方法在两个污染比例下\n      捕获的改善绝对量相当——更差的 baseline 确实提供更大 room，但 ESS 约束\n      同步收紧抵消了大部分额外空间。\n      b* 分布左移是 ESS 约束在高污染下正确工作的信号——防止过度 downweight\n      导致有效 batch size 崩溃。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Effect Amplification: ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6\"\n        columns: [metric, rho_0.4, rho_0.6, amplification]\n        rows:\n          - [uniform_ppl, 17.69, 18.50, \"-\"]\n          - [adaptive_ppl, 17.65, 18.45, \"-\"]\n          - [absolute_Δ, 0.04, 0.05, \"1.25x\"]\n          - [relative_improvement_pct, 0.226, 0.270, \"1.20x\"]\n          - [b_star_median, 0.88, 0.62, \"-\"]\n          - [ess_binding_pct, 59.9, 72.0, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Contamination ratio vs relative PPL improvement 折线图（2 points），标注效应几乎未放大\"\n      - \"b* distribution: ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6 histogram overlay，展示左移及 ESS binding 增加\"\n    analysis: >\n      效应放大有限（1.25x）不足以作为独立 selling point。但方向正确（正值、自适应响应），\n      支持方法在不同污染下仍可工作。更重要的发现是 b* 自适应响应 contamination 变化\n      的能力本身——b* median 从 0.88 降至 0.62 是方法 \"principled\" 的佐证。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\n    description: \"60% 污染下 grid-b=0.5 参考值\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.44\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.06\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.324\n      ratio_adaptive_vs_grid_at_60pct: 83.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Grid-b=0.5 在 ρ=0.6 下效应也增大（Δ 0.039→0.060，~1.5x），且放大略多于 adaptive，\n      因 b=0.5 固定值不受 ESS 约束收紧影响。在高污染时 b=0.5 的固定 downweighting\n      恰好位于更有效区域——高 q 样本更多意味着 b=0.5 的总体 downweight 效果更强。\n      Adaptive vs grid ratio 83.3%（vs ρ=0.4 的 88.6%）略降，因 adaptive b* median (0.62)\n      在 ρ=0.6 时被 ESS 约束拉到比 b=0.5 更低的值。\n      这暗示在高污染场景下，ESS 约束可能过于保守——dual-constraint 的 min-intervention\n      原则在此有潜在代价。但代价很小（PPL 差 0.01），不影响核心叙事。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 下 ratio 略降，但 adaptive 仍在 grid-b=0.5 的 seed variance 范围内。\n      支持 \"不同污染比例下 adaptive 始终 comparable to fixed b\" 的 robustness 叙事。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: n_min Sensitivity — 完整 5-point curve\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_1\n    description: \"ESS 约束最宽松——仅需 1 个有效样本\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.655\n      b_star_mean: 1.85\n      b_star_median: 1.15\n      b_star_std: 2.6\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 6.8\n      b_star_max: 20\n      train_loss: 7.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 与 n_min=2 差异不大（PPL 17.655 vs 17.650，仅差 0.005）。\n      关键原因：在 batch_size=4、ρ=0.4 设定下，ESS 约束在 n_min=2 时对大多数 batch\n      已非 binding（~50% batch 为 clean 即 b*=0，另有 ~20% batch α_eff 是 binding）。\n      n_min 从 2 降到 1 仅松弛了那些 ESS 恰好在 1-2 之间被 clamp 的 batch（约 10-15%），\n      这些 batch 的 b* 从被截断值升至更高值，但 PPL landscape 平坦性确保影响可忽略。\n      b* 分布右移（mean 1.40→1.85, median 0.88→1.15）反映少量 batch b* 释放，\n      但尾部极端值（b*>5 占 6.8%）增加的梯度噪声被其他 batch 平均化稀释。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* histogram: n_min=1 vs n_min=2 overlay，展示右尾膨胀但主体变化不大\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 可用且与 n_min=2 几乎等价。确认在当前设定下 ESS 约束对多数 batch 非 binding，\n      降低 n_min 的边际效应很小。支持 \"n_min 是一个不敏感的 empirical default\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_4\n    description: \"ESS = batch_size，预期退化为 uniform\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_at_zero: 100.0\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      effective_behavior: \"uniform\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min = batch_size = 4 要求 ESS >= 4，即 Kish's ESS = (Σw_i)²/Σw_i² 达到样本总数。\n      数学上这仅当所有权重完全相等时满足（w_i = c for all i），即 b*=0（所有权重为 1）。\n      对任何 b>0，至少一个 w_i = (1-q_i)^b < 1（因为 q_i > 0），使 ESS < 4。\n      因此所有 batch 被迫 b*=0，方法完全退化为 uniform training，PPL = 17.69。\n      价值：建立 sensitivity curve 的理论上界，证明 ESS 约束过紧时方法优雅退化。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"n_min=4 确认理论预期：ESS 约束过紧 → 优雅退化为 uniform，不崩溃不发散。\"\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_5\n    description: \"n_min > batch_size 的退化验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      effective_behavior: \"uniform\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4 是物理不可能满足的约束（4 个样本的 ESS 最大为 4）。\n      与 n_min=4 结果完全一致：b*=0, uniform 行为, PPL=17.69。\n      Sanity check 确认代码在超范围边界条件下正确 fallback 到 b*=0，无异常行为。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"n_min Sensitivity Summary (seed42, ρ=0.4, batch_size=4)\"\n        columns: [n_min, eval_ppl, b_star_median, effective_mode, notes]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 17.655, 1.15, \"adaptive\", \"ESS 约束几乎无约束力，与 n_min=2 差异 <0.005\"]\n          - [2, 17.650, 0.88, \"adaptive\", \"Sweet spot (adaptive_fix default)\"]\n          - [3, 17.690, 0.45, \"partially clamped\", \"seed42 退化（known D012），ESS 过紧\"]\n          - [4, 17.690, 0.0, \"uniform\", \"n_min=batch_size → 仅 b*=0 可行\"]\n          - [5, 17.690, 0.0, \"uniform\", \"不可满足约束 → fallback b*=0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"n_min sensitivity curve (5 points)：n_min=1-2 平台，n_min>=3 cliff（at batch_size=4）\"\n    analysis: >\n      完整 5-point curve：n_min=1 和 n_min=2 都可工作且几乎等价，选择不敏感。\n      n_min>=3 在 batch_size=4 下退化是 batch size 的 artifact 而非方法固有缺陷。\n      论文呈现此 curve + batch_size=8/16 消融共同证明 \"n_min=2 是安全的跨设定默认值\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: ESS-only Baseline — 核心对照实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ESS-only adaptive baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_ess_only_baseline\n    description: \"max{b : ESS≥n_min} vs inf{b : α_eff≥τ} s.t. ESS≥n_min — head-to-head 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.66\n      delta_vs_dual: 0.01\n      delta_significant: false\n      b_star_mean_ess_only: 4.15\n      b_star_median_ess_only: 3.20\n      b_star_std_ess_only: 3.8\n      ess_at_b_star_mean: 2.05\n      train_loss: 9.85\n      alpha_eff_binding_irrelevant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      ESS-only 选择 max{b : ESS≥2}——在 ESS 允许范围内最大 downweight。\n      b* median 3.20（vs dual 0.88）反映 max-intervention 策略：尽可能多地清洁。\n      但 PPL 17.66 与 dual 的 17.65 仅差 0.01，统计不可区分（seed variance ~0.01）。\n      核心原因仍是 PPL landscape 平坦——在 b=0.3-5.0 范围内 PPL 仅变化 0.17，\n      而 ESS-only 的 b* median 3.20 对应 grid-b=3.0 的 PPL 17.774，但 per-batch adaptive\n      选择的 b* 并非固定在 3.20——低污染 batch 仍选 b*=0，高污染 batch 才选大 b*，\n      这种 adaptive 行为部分缓解了 max-intervention 的损失。\n      两个方法的 eval_ppl 差异 <0.01 确认 α_eff 约束不提供独立的 empirical 性能贡献。\n      但 dual-constraint 的 b* 分布更集中（std 1.93 vs 3.8），梯度方差更小，\n      理论上在更大模型/更长训练中可能有优势——这是可声称的 principled advantage。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Dual-Constraint vs ESS-only Head-to-Head (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [metric, dual_constraint, ess_only, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [eval_ppl_holdout, 17.650, 17.660, 0.010]\n          - [b_star_mean, 1.40, 4.15, 2.75]\n          - [b_star_median, 0.88, 3.20, 2.32]\n          - [b_star_std, 1.93, 3.80, 1.87]\n          - [train_loss, 7.52, 9.85, 2.33]\n          - [ess_at_reweighted_mean, 2.60, 2.05, -0.55]\n          - [gradient_variance_relative, 1.0, 1.35, 0.35]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双轴图：b* distribution overlay (dual vs ESS-only)，突出 2.5x 差异\"\n      - \"PPL 对比 bar chart with seed variance error bars，可视化 'indistinguishable'\"\n    analysis: >\n      Dual ≈ ESS-only 在 eval_ppl 上不可区分。论文叙事转向：\n      \"两种 adaptive 策略都消除 grid search，性能等价。Dual-constraint 推荐为默认方案\n      因其有收敛理论支撑的 principled 推导框架，且 b* 分布更集中（lower gradient variance）\n      提供理论上的稳定性优势——尽管在当前实验规模下未观测到 PPL 差异。\"\n      α_eff 的贡献从 \"性能贡献\" reframe 为 \"principled derivation + interpretability\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: τ Sweep — Claim 3 证据\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"τ sweep (τ=0.5/0.6/0.7/0.9/0.95, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_tau_sweep\n    description: \"τ 全范围扫描，验证方法对 τ 的敏感度及有效工作范围\"\n    expected_results:\n      tau_05_eval_ppl: 17.70\n      tau_06_eval_ppl: 17.66\n      tau_07_eval_ppl: 17.65\n      tau_08_eval_ppl: 17.65\n      tau_09_eval_ppl: 17.68\n      tau_095_eval_ppl: 17.72\n      ppl_range: 0.07\n      ppl_std: 0.027\n      robust_range: \"[0.6, 0.8]\"\n      best_tau: 0.7\n      best_ppl: 17.65\n      tau_05_b_star_median: 0.25\n      tau_06_b_star_median: 0.55\n      tau_07_b_star_median: 0.72\n      tau_08_b_star_median: 0.88\n      tau_09_b_star_median: 1.85\n      tau_095_b_star_median: 3.50\n      tau_05_reweighted_pct: 22.0\n      tau_06_reweighted_pct: 38.0\n      tau_07_reweighted_pct: 45.0\n      tau_08_reweighted_pct: 50.1\n      tau_09_reweighted_pct: 58.0\n      tau_095_reweighted_pct: 65.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      τ 在 [0.6, 0.8] 内鲁棒（PPL 差异 ≤0.01），但边界退化明显：\n      τ=0.5 退化机制——阈值过低，α_eff(0)=1-mean(q)≈0.4 < 0.5 仅在高污染 batch 触发\n      小幅 reweighting（仅 22% batch 被 reweight，b* median 仅 0.25），接近 uniform 行为，\n      PPL 17.70 vs uniform 17.69 几乎无改善（Δ=-0.01 即 noise）。\n      τ=0.9/0.95 退化机制——阈值过高，α_eff(b) 需要很大 b 才能达到 0.9/0.95，\n      大多数 batch 的 b* 被推到高值（median 1.85/3.50），ESS 约束频繁触发导致 b* 被 clamp，\n      部分 batch 在 α_eff 无法达到 τ 的情况下被 clamp 到 ESS 边界——\n      实质退化为 ESS-only 行为但多了一层无效计算。过度 downweighting 增大梯度方差。\n      [0.6, 0.8] 鲁棒的直觉：这个范围对应 \"每个 batch 至少 60-80% 有效真实贡献\"，\n      与 ρ=0.4 的真实比例 0.6 匹配良好——阈值在真实比例附近宽幅可工作。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"τ Sensitivity Sweep (seed42, ρ=0.4, n_min=2)\"\n        columns: [τ, eval_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform, b_star_median, reweighted_pct, regime]\n        rows:\n          - [0.5, 17.70, -0.01, 0.25, \"22%\", \"under-reweight (≈uniform)\"]\n          - [0.6, 17.66, -0.03, 0.55, \"38%\", \"working (robust range)\"]\n          - [0.7, 17.65, -0.04, 0.72, \"45%\", \"working (near optimal)\"]\n          - [0.8, 17.65, -0.04, 0.88, \"50%\", \"working (current default)\"]\n          - [0.9, 17.68, -0.01, 1.85, \"58%\", \"over-reweight (boundary)\"]\n          - [0.95, 17.72, 0.03, 3.50, \"65%\", \"over-reweight (degraded)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"τ vs eval_ppl U-curve，标注 robust range [0.6, 0.8] 和边界退化区域\"\n      - \"τ vs b_star_median 单调递增曲线，展示 τ 如何控制 downweighting 强度\"\n    analysis: >\n      τ 在 [0.6, 0.8] 宽幅鲁棒（4 个 τ 值 PPL 差异 ≤ 0.01），支持 Claim 3 的修正版本：\n      \"τ 是一个不敏感的 empirical default with theoretical motivation，\n      在宽泛范围内均可工作，但不能声称全域不敏感——边界 τ 导致 0.03-0.07 PPL 退化。\"\n      与 n_min sensitivity 联合构成双超参 robustness 证据。\n      建议论文推荐 τ=0.7 或 τ=0.8 为默认值，差异在 noise 内。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Golden Ratio Oracle Baseline\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Golden Ratio oracle baseline (w=1/φ, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_golden_ratio_baseline\n    description: \"已知比例 oracle baseline：synthetic weight = 1/φ ≈ 0.618\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.64\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.05\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.282\n      ratio_adaptive_vs_golden: 80.0\n      weight_synthetic: 0.618\n      weight_real: 1.0\n      effective_ess_per_batch: 3.45\n      train_loss: 8.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      Golden Ratio (w*=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic, 1.0 for real) 使用已知比例 k=0.4 的 oracle 信息，\n      理论上是最优固定权重（arXiv 2502.18049）。PPL 17.64 与 adaptive 17.65 持平或略优（差 0.01），\n      因为 oracle 避免了 per-batch b* 估计的噪声——每个 batch 的权重固定且最优。\n      略优但非显著优（0.01 < seed variance 0.01），说明 adaptive 在不知道比例的情况下\n      已达到接近 oracle 性能——这是 Claim 3 的强支撑证据。\n      与 ESS-only ≈ dual 的发现联合：三种 adaptive 策略（dual, ESS-only, golden ratio oracle）\n      在当前 PPL landscape 下都收敛到相似性能，因为 b=0.2-1.0 区间 PPL 极度平坦。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Method Comparison Including Oracle (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [method, requires_known_ratio, eval_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform]\n        rows:\n          - [\"uniform\", \"no\", 17.690, 0.000]\n          - [\"adaptive (dual)\", \"no\", 17.650, -0.040]\n          - [\"ESS-only\", \"no\", 17.660, -0.030]\n          - [\"golden ratio oracle\", \"yes (k=0.4)\", 17.640, -0.050]\n          - [\"grid-best (b=0.3)\", \"no (but needs grid search)\", 17.648, -0.042]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 5 methods PPL comparison with seed variance error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Golden ratio oracle 略优但与 adaptive 不可区分（Δ=0.01 < seed var）。\n      论文叙事：adaptive 在不知道 contamination ratio 的条件下达到接近 oracle 性能，\n      验证方法设计的合理性。不需要已知比例也能接近理论最优。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Batch Size Ablation — 证明 n_min knife-edge 是 bs=4 artifact\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"batch_size=8 + grad_accum=2 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: p0_batchsize_8\n    description: \"更大 micro-batch 下 adaptive b* 行为及 n_min=2 有效性\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.64\n      b_star_mean: 1.35\n      b_star_median: 0.85\n      b_star_std: 1.65\n      n_min_ratio: 0.25\n      ess_binding_pct: 48.0\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 23.0\n      clean_batch_pct: 29.0\n      nmin3_would_work: true\n      nmin3_simulated_ppl: 17.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=8 使 per-batch q-score 统计更稳定（8 样本 vs 4 样本的分布估计方差降 ~50%），\n      b* 分布略收窄（std 1.93→1.65）。n_min/batch_size = 2/8 = 0.25 远低于 0.5（at bs=4），\n      ESS 约束大幅松弛——ESS binding 比例从 ~60% 降至 ~48%。\n      PPL 微改善 17.65→17.64（差 0.01），来自更准确的 per-batch b* 估计。\n      关键发现：在 bs=8 下 n_min=3 也能工作（模拟 PPL ~17.65），\n      证明 n_min=3 在 bs=4 的退化（D012）是小 batch 的 artifact——\n      n_min/batch_size 比值才是关键参数，而非 n_min 绝对值。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Batch Size Effect on Adaptive b* (n_min=2, seed42)\"\n        columns: [batch_size, grad_accum, eval_ppl, b_star_median, ess_binding_pct, n_min_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [4, 4, 17.650, 0.88, 59.9, 0.50]\n          - [8, 2, 17.640, 0.85, 48.0, 0.25]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* distribution at batch_size=4 vs 8 vs 16 overlay histogram\"\n    analysis: >\n      bs=8 确认 n_min knife-edge 随 batch size 消解。n_min=2 在 bs>=8 时约束极松。\n      支持论文 Reviewer concern 应对：\"n_min=3 退化是 bs=4 artifact，\n      更大 batch (实际使用场景) 下 n_min 选择完全不敏感。\"\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=16 + grad_accum=1 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42, adaptive)\"\n    plan_id: p0_batchsize_16\n    description: \"最大 micro-batch 下 adaptive b* 行为\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.64\n      b_star_mean: 1.32\n      b_star_median: 0.83\n      b_star_std: 1.50\n      n_min_ratio: 0.125\n      ess_binding_pct: 38.0\n      alpha_eff_binding_pct: 28.0\n      clean_batch_pct: 14.0\n      b_star_trajectory_smooth: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=16 进一步改善 per-batch 统计估计质量。b* 分布最集中（std 1.50），\n      因 16 样本的 q-score 均值/方差估计更准确。ESS binding 继续下降至 38%，\n      因 n_min/batch = 2/16 = 0.125 极低——ESS 约束实际不起作用。\n      α_eff binding 比例增加至 28%（vs bs=4 的 20.2%），因 batch 更大时\n      几乎每个 batch 都有足够的合成样本混入，需要 reweighting。\n      PPL 与 bs=8 持平（17.64），说明 bs=8 已足够获得 b* 估计的大部分收益。\n      b* 轨迹更平滑（batch-to-batch 变化更小），训练更稳定但 PPL 未进一步改善——\n      确认 PPL landscape 平坦性在不同 batch granularity 下的一致性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Batch Size Sweep Summary (adaptive, n_min=2, seed42)\"\n        columns: [batch_size, eval_ppl, b_star_std, ess_binding_pct, α_eff_binding_pct, clean_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [4, 17.650, 1.93, 59.9, 20.2, 49.9]\n          - [8, 17.640, 1.65, 48.0, 23.0, 29.0]\n          - [16, 17.640, 1.50, 38.0, 28.0, 14.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel: batch_size vs (eval_ppl, b_star_std, ess_binding_pct)\"\n      - \"b* 轨迹 time series 三行对比，展示 bs 越大越平滑\"\n    analysis: >\n      bs=8 和 bs=16 性能持平，说明 bs=8 已足够。n_min knife-edge 在 bs>=8 完全消失。\n      论文可 claim：\"n_min=2 是安全的跨 batch-size 默认值，\n      且在实际使用场景（bs>=8）下 n_min 选择完全不敏感。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Detector Quality Ablation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_modernbert\n    description: \"高质量 ModernBERT 检测器用于 detector quality ablation\"\n    expected_results:\n      auc: 0.986\n      accuracy: 0.962\n      ece_calibrated: 0.025\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.42\n      q_score_bimodality: \"强——接近 0/1 两极化\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 基于 transformer 语义特征（上下文连贯性、语义深度），\n      比 TF-IDF+LR 表面特征（n-gram 频率、词汇分布）更准确，AUC 0.939→0.986 (+0.047)\n      与 Drayson et al. 报告一致。q-score 分布更双峰化（std 0.374→0.42）——\n      transformer 特征使真实/合成样本被更明确区分，q 值集中在 [0,0.1] 和 [0.9,1.0]。\n      更好的校准（ECE 0.048→0.025）来自 transformer 的更强表征能力——\n      输出概率更准确反映真实后验。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"两个检测器 ROC 曲线叠加 + q-score 分布直方图对比\"\n    analysis: \"为 detector quality ablation 提供高质量对照组。Setup 步骤。\"\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_ablation_training\n    description: \"检测器质量 ablation：AUC 提升 5% 换来多少 PPL 改善\"\n    expected_results:\n      adaptive_modernbert_ppl: 17.645\n      uniform_modernbert_ppl: 17.69\n      improvement_vs_tfidf_adaptive: 0.005\n      b_star_mean_modernbert: 1.25\n      b_star_median_modernbert: 0.78\n      ratio_vs_grid_modernbert: 90.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高 AUC 提供更准确 q-score，但 PPL landscape 极平坦，更好的 q-score 仅带来\n      微小改善（17.645 vs TF-IDF 的 17.650，差 0.005，远小于 seed variance）。\n      b* median 更低（0.78 vs 0.88），因为 ModernBERT q-score 更双峰化，\n      高 q 样本 q 值更接近 1.0，相同 b 下权重更小（w=(1-0.95)^b << (1-0.85)^b），\n      ESS 更快触及下界，b* 被限制在更小值。\n      关键 co-finding：AUC 从 0.939→0.986（+5%）仅换来 0.005 PPL（0.03% relative），\n      边际收益极低。因为 reweighting 依赖 q-score 的 ranking 而非绝对精度——\n      只要 q-score 的 rank order 大致正确（AUC>0.9），adaptive b* 就能工作。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Detector Quality Ablation\"\n        columns: [detector, AUC, adaptive_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform, ratio_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TF-IDF+LR\", 0.939, 17.650, -0.040, 88.6]\n          - [\"ModernBERT\", 0.986, 17.645, -0.045, 90.5]\n          - [\"Δ_detector\", \"+0.047\", \"-0.005\", \"-0.005\", \"+1.9\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detector AUC vs adaptive PPL scatter (2 points)，标注边际收益递减\"\n    analysis: >\n      Detector quality ablation 产生关键 co-finding：AUC 0.939 即足够，\n      无需昂贵 ModernBERT。lightweight detector sufficiency 可升级为 co-contribution。\n      \"calibration (low ECE) > classification accuracy (high AUC)\"——\n      TF-IDF 校准后 ECE=0.048 已足够支撑有效的 b* 推导。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Cross-Generator Robustness\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_datagen\n    description: \"跨生成器合成数据准备\"\n    expected_results:\n      synthetic_source: \"Llama-3.2-1B\"\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      contamination_ratio: 0.4\n      detector_auc_cross_gen: 0.925\n      q_score_mean: 0.55\n      q_score_std: 0.39\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨模型生成的合成数据风格不同（Llama 倾向更长句子、不同词汇偏好），\n      TF-IDF+LR 检测器 AUC 下降 0.939→0.925（-0.014），因检测器训练在 Qwen 生成数据上，\n      对 Llama 风格泛化略弱。但 AUC 仍 >0.9，说明 n-gram 特征对合成文本的\n      通用统计特征（低困惑度、高重复率、有限 vocabulary 子集）有一定泛化能力。\n      q-score 均值下降（0.60→0.55）反映检测器对 OOD 合成样本信心降低。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"跨生成器数据准备。检测器在 OOD 生成器上 AUC 下降 ~1.5%，仍可用。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_training\n    description: \"跨生成器场景下 adaptive 表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.72\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.69\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.03\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.169\n      ratio_vs_in_distribution: 75.0\n      b_star_mean: 1.55\n      b_star_median: 0.95\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨生成器是 adaptive 表现较弱的设置。Llama 生成的合成数据与 Qwen 分布差异更大，\n      uniform 略差（17.72 vs 17.69，跨生成器合成数据更难学习）。\n      但 adaptive 改善仅 0.03（vs in-distribution 0.04），ratio 降至 ~75%。\n      两个原因：(1) 检测器 AUC 下降使 q-score 精度降低——高概率真实样本被误判为\n      中等 q，导致不必要的 downweighting；(2) 跨生成器合成数据 q-score 分布更分散\n      （std 0.39 vs 0.37），per-batch 统计量噪声更大，b* 估计质量下降。\n      仍为正方向改善，说明方法在 OOD 检测条件下仍有价值但效果打折。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"In-distribution vs Cross-generator\"\n        columns: [setting, generator, detector_AUC, uniform_ppl, adaptive_ppl, ratio_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"in-distribution\", \"Qwen3-0.6B\", 0.939, 17.69, 17.65, 88.6]\n          - [\"cross-generator\", \"Llama-3.2-1B\", 0.925, 17.72, 17.69, 75.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-batch b* distribution: in-distribution vs cross-generator overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-generator 拉低 aggregate ratio 至 ~75%，是跨设定 win rate 下降的主因之一。\n      论文中需 per-batch b* 诊断解释，并指出这是 detector OOD 泛化问题而非方法缺陷。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Llama-3.2-3B — 跨模型验证\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: p1_llama3b_setup\n    description: \"3B 模型环境准备、数据适配\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_size_gb: 6.2\n      gpu_memory_usage_gb: 72\n      detector_auc_reused: 0.939\n      gradient_checkpointing: true\n      batch_size: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      使用与 Qwen3-0.6B 相同的合成数据（Qwen 生成），Llama 训练（cross-architecture 设置）。\n      TF-IDF+LR 检测器基于文本 n-gram 特征，不依赖训练/推理模型架构，AUC 不变。\n      4× RTX 6000 96GB 可 fit 3B（weights ~6.2GB FP16 + optimizer states ×2 + activations），\n      需 gradient checkpointing（峰值显存 ~72GB），micro-batch size 降至 2。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Setup 步骤。3B 可在当前 GPU 配置训练，需 gradient checkpointing + 小 batch。\"\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p1_llama3b_uniform\n    description: \"3B 模型 uniform baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 13.52\n      train_loss: 5.88\n      total_steps: 3800\n      train_runtime_s: 43200\n      gpu_hours: 48.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-3B 容量是 Qwen3-0.6B 的 5x，在相同数据上 PPL 显著更低（13.52 vs 17.69）。\n      更大模型更好地建模语言分布——即使 40% 数据为合成污染，3B 的表征能力足够\n      学到真实语言的核心结构。训练时间大幅增加（~12h vs ~3.3h per seed），\n      步数因 micro-batch size = 2（vs 4）和 grad_accum 调整而不同。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"3B uniform baseline 建立跨模型对比参考点。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p1_llama3b_adaptive\n    description: \"3B 模型上 adaptive b* 的跨模型泛化\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 13.46\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.06\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.444\n      amplification_vs_0_6B: 1.96\n      b_star_mean: 1.38\n      b_star_median: 0.85\n      b_star_std: 1.90\n      ratio_vs_estimated_grid: 85.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型效应放大约 2x（relative improvement 0.226%→0.444%），落在 median tier 1.5-3x 范围。\n      放大来自模型容量增加——3B 有足够参数捕捉更细微的真实/合成分布差异，\n      从 reweighting 获益更多。但仍为温和放大，0.44% relative 不构成独立 selling point。\n      b* 分布与 0.6B 高度相似（median 0.85 vs 0.88），因为 b* 由 batch q-score 统计量决定，\n      与模型大小无关——这是方法 \"principled\" 的直接证据。\n      关键发现：adaptive b* 在不同模型上无需任何调整即可工作，\n      vs Drayson 的 per-model b 选择（0.6B 用 b=10, 1.7B 用 b=1）优势明显。\n      但 n_min=2 at batch_size=2 → n_min/batch = 1.0 → ESS 约束极紧。\n      可能需要将 n_min 降至 1 或调整 batch 设置以避免 ESS over-constraining。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Model Comparison (ρ=0.4, adaptive)\"\n        columns: [model, params, uniform_ppl, adaptive_ppl, rel_improvement_pct, b_star_median]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.6B\", 17.69, 17.65, 0.226, 0.88]\n          - [\"Llama-3.2-3B\", \"3.0B\", 13.52, 13.46, 0.444, 0.85]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Model size vs relative PPL improvement 图（2 个模型点）\"\n      - \"b* distribution overlay: Qwen3-0.6B vs Llama-3.2-3B（高度重合）\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨模型泛化成功，b* 分布跨模型稳定是 principled method 的佐证。\n      论文强调 \"zero-tuning-cost across model scales\" + b* 分布的模型无关性。\n      但 batch_size=2 的 n_min 问题需在论文中说明——推荐在小 batch 下使用 n_min=1。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Additional Baselines\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_detect_remove\n    description: \"硬过滤 baseline 对比——soft reweighting vs hard filtering\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.685\n      effective_training_tokens: 130000000\n      data_retention_rate: 0.65\n      false_positive_rate: 0.08\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.005\n    result_rationale: >\n      硬过滤（q>0.5 移除）有两个系统性问题：\n      (1) 移除 ~35% 数据中含 ~8% 误分类真实数据（AUC=0.939 对应 FPR ~8%），\n      训练数据净减少导致 underfitting 压力——130M 有效 tokens vs 200M 的信息量损失大；\n      (2) 二元决策丢弃 q-score 连续信息——q=0.51 和 q=0.99 被同等移除，\n      但 q=0.51 的样本可能有一半概率是真实数据。\n      PPL 17.685 仅比 uniform 好 0.005（12.5% of adaptive 改善），远逊于 adaptive (17.65)。\n      强力支持 soft reweighting > hard filtering 的实现路径选择。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Method Comparison (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n        columns: [method, eval_ppl, Δ_vs_uniform, effective_tokens]\n        rows:\n          - [\"uniform\", 17.690, 0.000, \"200M\"]\n          - [\"detect-and-remove\", 17.685, -0.005, \"130M\"]\n          - [\"grid-best (b=0.3)\", 17.648, -0.042, \"200M\"]\n          - [\"adaptive (dual)\", 17.650, -0.040, \"200M\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: four methods PPL comparison with error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Detect-and-remove 几乎无效（0.005 PPL），强力支持 loss reweighting 路径。\n      与 Drayson SIR（离散重采样）的隐含对比：continuous control > discrete selection。\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_random_reweight\n    description: \"验证 detector signal 是改善的必要来源\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      delta_vs_uniform: 0.005\n      effective_behavior: \"random noise, slight degradation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重不含 contamination 信号，等价于给 SGD 添加 per-sample 乘性噪声。\n      比 uniform 略差（17.695 vs 17.690，+0.005），因随机权重增加梯度估计方差——\n      部分真实样本被无端 downweight 而部分合成样本被 upweight。\n      关键对照：adaptive 改善 0.04 PPL 确实来自 detector q-score 的 contamination 信号，\n      而非 reweighting 本身的正则化效应（如 dropout-like 效果）。\n      \"Detector signal is load-bearing\" 是可量化的结论。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      随机 reweighting 无效甚至略有害，确认 detector signal 是改善来源。\n      论文中作为 \"signal necessity\" ablation，一行结果即可。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extended Validation\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p2_domain_skewed\n    description: \"非均匀域分布污染场景——合成数据集中在 code 域\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.71\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.69\n      improvement_over_uniform: 0.02\n      relative_improvement_pct: 0.113\n      ratio_vs_uniform_injection: 50.0\n      b_star_cross_batch_variance: \"高\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-skewed injection 使合成数据集中在特定域（code-heavy），batch 间 q-score\n      分布差异极大：code-heavy batch q-score 均高（mean ~0.9），其他 batch 接近纯 real。\n      Per-batch α_eff(b) 估计不稳定——code batch 的 4 个样本中 3-4 个高 q，\n      q-score 几乎无变异性（std ~0.05），违反 b* 推导的隐含假设（需要 batch 内 q 有足够 spread）。\n      Code-heavy batch 在 \"全高 q → 任何 b>0 使 ESS 剧降 → b* 被 clamp 到 0 或极小值\"\n      和 \"有足够变异 → 正常 b*\" 之间振荡，adaptive 在此场景表现最弱（ratio ~50%）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-batch b* 轨迹图，标注 code-heavy batch 的 b* 异常模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-skewed 暴露方法弱点：per-batch 估计假设 batch 内 q-score 有足够变异性。\n      论文需在 Limitations 中讨论此现象，并指出缓解方案（更大 batch size, 跨 batch smoothing）。\n      此场景超出 \"uniform random injection\" 的基本假设，不影响核心 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: p2_downstream_eval\n    description: \"下游任务评估——验证 PPL 改善是否转移至 benchmark\"\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_uniform: 34.2\n      mmlu_adaptive: 34.35\n      mmlu_delta: 0.15\n      mmlu_significance: \"not significant (p>0.1)\"\n      hellaswag_uniform: 52.8\n      hellaswag_adaptive: 53.1\n      hellaswag_delta: 0.3\n      hellaswag_significance: \"marginal (p~0.08)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Downstream 改善不一致是 median tier 核心预期。\n      MMLU +0.15% 完全在随机波动范围内——3B 在仅 200M tokens 后 MMLU 远未收敛，\n      baseline ~34% 表明模型仍处于初始化附近（random baseline 25%），信噪比极低。\n      HellaSwag +0.3% 更可能被检测到（对 PPL/language modeling 更直接敏感），\n      但单 seed 单 checkpoint 下 p~0.08 仍不达 0.05 显著性水平。\n      根本限制：200M tokens 预训练对 downstream tasks 信号极弱——\n      通常需 1B+ tokens 才开始看到 meaningful benchmark 变化，\n      0.44% relative PPL 改善不足以穿透 downstream 的高方差。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Downstream Task Results (Llama-3.2-3B, ρ=0.4)\"\n        columns: [task, uniform, adaptive, Δ, significant]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU (5-shot)\", 34.2, 34.35, \"+0.15\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag (0-shot)\", 52.8, 53.1, \"+0.3\", \"Marginal\"]\n          - [\"eval_ppl\", 13.52, 13.46, \"-0.06\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Downstream performance bar chart with error bars + significance markers\"\n    analysis: >\n      下游改善不一致且不显著。论文策略：PPL 为主要评估指标，downstream 作 supplementary。\n      Limitations 中明确说明 200M tokens 规模不足以展现 downstream 统计显著差异，\n      更大规模训练（>1B tokens）是 future work。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c2699f91-58b1-43cd-84dd-ccef8205b378","total_cost_usd":1.3401903499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49298,"cache_read_input_tokens":84016,"output_tokens":33027,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49298,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":32504,"cache_read_input_tokens":37931,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22814,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22814},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":17778,"outputTokens":5063,"cacheReadInputTokens":250581,"cacheCreationInputTokens":76979,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.16437485,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":33027,"cacheReadInputTokens":84016,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49298,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.1758155,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"5c5ff43a-9e7f-432e-93f2-5624936cd020"}
